* Fluid on Solana
** Deployment
*** Six Anchor programs
*** Business Source License 1.1
*** 12-hour timelock upgrade multisig
*** Program authority vs init authority
*** Shipped as Jupiter Lend
** Liquidity layer
*** One TokenReserve per mint
*** operate(supply, borrow) signed amounts
*** Permissioned, reached only by CPI
*** Exchange prices at 1e12
*** Rate curve v1 (one kink) or v2 (two kinks)
*** Dynamic withdrawal and debt limits
** SVM adaptations
*** pre_operate balance snapshot
*** 1% input excess tolerance
*** TransferType CLAIM fallback
*** One PDA per tick and per branch
*** remaining_accounts_indices layout
*** Address lookup tables per vault
*** Decimals normalised to 9
** Vaults
*** ratio = 1.0015^tick x 2^48
*** Tick range -16383 to 16383
*** Branches and debt factor 35|15
*** Absorb above liquidation max limit
*** Position held as an SPL NFT
** Oracle
*** Up to four chained sources
*** Pyth, Chainlink, Redstone
*** Stake pool, mSOL, single pool, JupLend
*** Staleness 600 s operate, 7200 s liquidate
*** Confidence interval capped at 2% operate, 4% liquidate
** Flash loan
*** Instruction sysvar introspection
*** Exact payback discriminator and amount
*** Stack height must be one
*** Exactly one payback per borrow
** Lending
*** SPL mint carries the shares
*** deposit, mint, withdraw, redeem
*** Slippage-bounded variants
*** Rebalance syncs rewards
